  "title": "How to gracefully switch to a new code signing cert on Mac",
  "summary": "Transitioning from an individual developer's certificate to an organization's certificate for an Electron app on macOS can be a tricky process, particularly when it comes to **maintaining a seamless auto-update experience for your users**. In this guide, we'll walk through the steps to ensure a smooth transition between certificates, preventing errors and ensuring your app's designated requirements (DR) are met.",
